<title>USA: Alumax to close California plate plant.</title>
<headline>Alumax to close California plate plant.</headline>
<dateline>NORCROSS, Ga. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alumax Inc said on Tuesday it will close its plate plant in Riverside, Calif., by late 1997. The plant employs 95 people.</p>
<p>Alumax said it is consolidating and will supply customers from inventory and from its other plants.</p>
<p>The company's cast plates are used in the tool and die, aircraft and machinery industries.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
